# ── Machine learning artifacts (NEVER commit trained weights to git) ──────────
# Model weights can be hundreds of MB and contain sensitive training data.
# Use object storage or a model registry (e.g., DVC, MLflow, HuggingFace Hub).
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.pkl
backend/var/objectstore/models/

